OL,3,C'Breathing room' promises have
OL,4,Csqueezed fiscal headroom, says think
OL,5,Ctank
OL,7,FAndy Burnham's effort to give families
OL,8,F"breathing room" over the cost of
OL,9,Fliving has squeezed the fiscal
OL,10,Fheadroom to as little as #8 billion, a
OL,11,Fthink tank has estimated.
OL,13,FMr Burnham entered Downing Street as
OL,14,FPrime Minister for the first time this
OL,15,Fweek, pledging to lead a "cost-of-
OL,16,Fliving Government".
OL,26,@pD@AOUpD@PO]wD@ZOUxD@RO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
