OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,317,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31602
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F316A1785021538
OL,3,C'Breathing room' promises have
OL,4,Csqueezed fiscal headroom, says think
OL,5,Ctank
OL,7,FBut as he begins his first weekend in
OL,8,Fthe top job, the Prime Minister and
OL,9,Fhis pick for Chancellor John Healey
OL,10,Fare under pressure to say how they
OL,11,Fwill sustain a raft of support
OL,12,Fpackages they announced for bus
OL,13,Fpassengers, energy billpayers and pub
OL,14,Fpunters.
OL,16,FThe Resolution Foundation has
OL,17,Festimated that this week's pledges
OL,18,Fwill cost a total of more than #2
OL,19,Fbillion in 2029/30.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,317,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31603
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F316A1785021538
OL,3,C'Breathing room' promises have
OL,4,Csqueezed fiscal headroom, says think
OL,5,Ctank
OL,7,FIts estimate of the fiscal headroom `
OL,8,Fthe leeway the Government has against
OL,9,Fthe Chancellor's day-to-day spending
OL,10,Frules ` has fallen to #8 billion.
OL,12,FThis has plunged from the #23.6
OL,13,Fbillion estimate in early March,
OL,14,Fbefore the costs linked to the war in
OL,15,FIran began to set in.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,317,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31604
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F316A1785021538
OL,3,C'Breathing room' promises have
OL,4,Csqueezed fiscal headroom, says think
OL,5,Ctank
OL,7,F"The funding debate has focused on
OL,8,Fboth the flimsy detail of where the
OL,9,Fmoney is coming from, and the
OL,10,Fambiguity about whether the measures
OL,11,Fare permanent," the Resolution
OL,12,FFoundation's chief executive Ruth
OL,13,FCurtice said.
OL,15,F"The upshot is that either John Healey
OL,16,Fneeds to find more money in the
OL,17,Fbudget, or he needs to put up energy
OL,18,Fbills back up by 5%."
OL,26,@oD@AOUsD@OO]wD@AOUzD@UO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/10
