OL,3,C'Breathing room' promises have
OL,4,Csqueezed fiscal headroom, says think
OL,5,Ctank
OL,7,FMr Burnham this week said he would
OL,8,Fknock VAT off electricity bills in
OL,9,FEngland, Scotland and Wales from
OL,10,FOctober 1.
OL,12,FThe Government has estimated the move
OL,13,Fwill cost around #850 million in 2026-
OL,14,F27.
OL,16,FIt would be paid for by cancelling the
OL,17,Fdigital ID programme, which was
OL,18,Fexpected to cost #1.8 billion over
OL,19,Fthree years.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
