OL,3,C'Breathing room' promises have
OL,4,Csqueezed fiscal headroom, says think
OL,5,Ctank
OL,7,FThe Prime Minister also went to Bath,
OL,8,FSomerset, to celebrate his plan to
OL,9,Fbring the #3 bus fare cap down to #2
OL,10,Fthroughout 2027.
OL,12,FThis will be funded by turning
OL,13,Finternational climate grants into
OL,14,Floans, raising around #400 million,
OL,15,Fand raising a further #54 million from
OL,16,Fsavings in the Department for Energy
OL,17,FSecurity and Net Zero budget.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
