OL,3,C'Breathing room' promises have
OL,4,Csqueezed fiscal headroom, says think
OL,5,Ctank
OL,7,FMr Burnham spent Thursday morning at
OL,8,FThe Hare pub in Harlow, Essex, where
OL,9,Fhe unveiled business rates for pubs,
OL,10,Fclubs and live music venues would be
OL,11,Fcut by 20% from April next year.
OL,13,FThe move will cost the Treasury around
OL,14,F#100 million.
OL,16,FBut the discount will apply to nearly
OL,17,F32,000 hospitality businesses and is
OL,18,Fexpected to save a typical pub
OL,19,Fapproximately #1,100 annually.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,317,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31608
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F316A1785021538
OL,3,C'Breathing room' promises have
OL,4,Csqueezed fiscal headroom, says think
OL,5,Ctank
OL,7,F"I don't think I'll do the John
OL,8,FPrescott," he told Mr Healey with a
OL,9,Fpint in hand, referring to a famous
OL,10,Fvideo of the late former deputy prime
OL,11,Fminister downing a pint in one go.
OL,13,FMr Burnham has also launched No 10
OL,14,FNorth this week, hosting a meeting in
OL,15,FManchester with Cabinet ministers and
OL,16,Fdevolved mayors, including Mr Healey,
OL,17,FFirst Secretary of State Louise Haigh,
OL,18,FReform UK Mayor of Greater
OL,19,FLincolnshire Andrea Jenkyns and
OL,20,FConservative Mayor of the Tees Valley
OL,21,FLord Houchen of High Leven.
OL,26,@oD@AOUpD@JO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,317,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31609
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F316A1785021538
OL,3,C'Breathing room' promises have
OL,4,Csqueezed fiscal headroom, says think
OL,5,Ctank
OL,7,FHe said: "I just want to assure
OL,8,Feveryone around the table from all of
OL,9,Fthe different parts of England that No
OL,10,F10 North is at your service, here for
OL,11,Fyou to empower you more than that,
OL,12,Fempower the people that you represent,
OL,13,Fthe places where they live to make it
OL,14,Ffeel as though we're all part of a
OL,15,Fnational story where everyone is
OL,16,Fpulling in the same direction and
OL,17,Fwe're all beginning to feel positive
OL,18,Fchange in our community.
OL,26,@oD@JOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G9/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,317,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31610
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F316A1785021538
OL,3,C'Breathing room' promises have
OL,4,Csqueezed fiscal headroom, says think
OL,5,Ctank
OL,7,F"We can see positive change on our
OL,8,Fhigh streets and that's what No 10
OL,9,FNorth is all about."
OL,11,FConservative leader Kemi Badenoch
OL,12,Fearlier this week said Mr Burnham had
OL,13,Fgone on a "spending spree".
OL,15,FShe said: "Andy Burnham's answer is to
OL,16,Fcap one price and send the bill
OL,17,Fsomewhere else."
OL,19,FMrs Badenoch added: "Andy Burnham
OL,20,Fneeds to rule out tax rises to pay for
OL,21,Fhis spending spree."
